				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jamaisj" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6846344); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6846344&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607845505" alt="JamaisJ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6846344)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jamaisj" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6846344); return false;" >JamaisJ</a></span> <span class="odate time_1607845421 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">13 Dec 2020 07:43</span>
																	<br/>
						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Writing Help / Help: Ideas Critique</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/forum/t-13901392/the-7th-panzer-divison">The 7th Panzer Divison</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4843610">
									

<p>1) Thousands of tanks worldwide is a bit overkill. An SCP shouldn't be that powerful without a was to stop it ahead of time. Either provide a way to stop it or drop it. Also, you need to decide if the ghosts are just ghosts or have actual firepower.</p>
<p>2) While the basic concept shows some promise, you need to build on it a little. Top FIve Quickies:<br />
a) How did they escape back? Did they find a hole, make a deal, or just time out?<br />
b) How did they find out that they could control the ghost tanks?<br />
c) If you are building on the &quot;deserted soldier&quot; concept, why do they keep surrendering so quickly?<br />
d) How did they manage to hide from modern sensory equipment?<br />
e) What happens if they encounter a group of modern neo-Nazis?</p>
<p>3) Also, wouldn't Obskuracorp want an update on their radio?</p>
<p>Like I said: Good concept, just needs some filling in&#8230;.</p>

							</div>

								
					
