			<div class="content" id="post-content-4843567">
									

<p>So that's a detailed plot&#8230; but without some characterization, I don't think anyone would wanna read it.</p>
<p>Do you have some idea for actual characters that the reader can relate to (or be entertained by?) For example, characters with dimensions (not just nameless)</p>
<p><em>What I mean by this&#8230; is you're painting a picture using Corbenic and Insurgency&#8230; but not telling me anything about the characters. Also important to note that Corbenic isn't the organization&#8230;</em></p>
<p>Additionally, consider this: if COrbenic exists in the in-universe SCP-5000 does, then that's a new rash of humanity going to the next life once the Foundation kills everyone&#8230; as multiple alt reality Earths have arrived in Corbenic (that's where the triple moons came from) meaning Corbenic is not limited to one continua.</p>

